<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="reveal hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Commercial Cleaning · Office Service</p>
        <h1>Office cleaning that keeps the workplace ready, not just tidy.</h1>
        <p class="lede">S&amp;B provides recurring and one-time office cleaning built around how your workplace actually runs — and it's the same team that can restock your supplies and handle routine property upkeep, if you want that too.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn-primary">Request an Office Cleaning Quote</a>
          <a href="tel:+10000000000" class="btn-ghost">Call [(000) 000-0000]</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-strip">
          <span>Recurring or One-Time</span>
          <span>After-Hours Available</span>
          <span>Custom Scope</span>
          <span>Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal ph hero-photo" style="transition-delay:120ms;"><span>[Photo — Office Cleaning in Progress]</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap intro-grid">
      <div class="reveal intro-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Built Around Your Workplace</p>
        <h2 class="h2">A cleaning plan shaped by your office, not a generic checklist.</h2>
        <p>Employee schedules, visitor traffic, restroom count, flooring, breakrooms, and access all affect what a good office cleaning plan looks like. We walk the space first and build the scope around it, instead of quoting a package that was written for someone else's office.</p>
        <p>The proposal spells out exactly what's included, how often, and who's responsible for what — so there's nothing to guess at once service starts.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Scope based on your actual layout and traffic</li>
          <li>Clear frequency, tasks, and access terms in writing</li>
          <li>Adjustable as your workplace or headcount changes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal ph intro-photo" style="transition-delay:100ms;"><span>[Photo — Reception Area After Cleaning]</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="included">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="reveal section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scope of Service</p>
        <h2 class="h2">What an office cleaning visit can cover.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="included-grid">
        <div class="included-card reveal">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h3>Work Areas &amp; Private Offices</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Dusting accessible surfaces and ledges</li>
            <li>Trash removal and liner replacement</li>
            <li>Vacuuming, sweeping, and mopping</li>
            <li>Doors, handles, and shared-touchpoint cleaning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="included-card reveal" style="transition-delay:90ms;">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h3>Restrooms</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Toilets, urinals, sinks, and counters</li>
            <li>Mirrors and fixtures</li>
            <li>Floor cleaning and high-touch surfaces</li>
            <li>Restocking, when supplies are part of your plan</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="included-card reveal" style="transition-delay:180ms;">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h3>Breakrooms &amp; Shared Spaces</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Countertop and table wipe-downs</li>
            <li>Appliance exteriors and sinks</li>
            <li>Trash removal and floor cleaning</li>
            <li>Common touchpoints and shared surfaces</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="included-card reveal" style="transition-delay:270ms;">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <h3>Reception &amp; Client-Facing Areas</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Reception desk and waiting-area cleaning</li>
            <li>Conference table and surface dusting</li>
            <li>Interior entry glass and door touch-up</li>
            <li>Extra attention where visitors see it first</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bundle reveal">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8 12 3 3 8l9 5 9-5Z"/><path d="M3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8"/><path d="M12 13v8"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Add supply restocking to the same visit</h3>
          <p>Paper goods, soap, and liners can be tracked and restocked by the same team that cleans your office — one fewer thing for your staff to notice running low.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="index.html#pillars" class="btn-ghost" style="border-color:#fff;color:#fff;">See Supplies →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frequency">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="reveal section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Scheduling</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Frequency built around how busy the space is.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="freq-grid">
        <div class="freq-card reveal"><h4>Nightly / 5x Weekly</h4><p>Busy offices, medical or professional facilities, and multi-tenant workplaces with heavy restroom and breakroom use.</p></div>
        <div class="freq-card reveal" style="transition-delay:60ms;"><h4>3x Per Week</h4><p>Active workplaces that need consistent upkeep without service every single business day.</p></div>
        <div class="freq-card reveal" style="transition-delay:120ms;"><h4>2x Per Week</h4><p>Moderate-traffic offices where restrooms, floors, and shared spaces still need dependable attention.</p></div>
        <div class="freq-card reveal" style="transition-delay:180ms;"><h4>Weekly</h4><p>A common fit for smaller offices or lower-traffic workplaces with limited staff and visitors.</p></div>
        <div class="freq-card reveal" style="transition-delay:240ms;"><h4>Biweekly</h4><p>Works when onsite staff handle basic upkeep between professional cleaning visits.</p></div>
        <div class="freq-card reveal" style="transition-delay:300ms;"><h4>One-Time / Deep Clean</h4><p>No recurring contract required — useful for resets, relocations, management transitions, or a space that just needs extra attention once.</p></div>
      </div>
